-- Enrichment Batch 19 (2026-10-28), Austria national additions following cleanup pass 112,
-- each verified first-hand on official pages the same day:
--   970 DOC Fellowship - Austrian Academy of Sciences (ÖAW) (rel 10)
--   971 Ernst Mach Grant - worldwide (OeAD)                 (rel 9; open until 2026-12-01)
-- sources 3104 (ÖAW DOC page) / 3105 (OeAD Ernst Mach page); links 970->3104, 971->3105.
-- No university_scholarships rows: both schemes attach to any Austrian university.
